  "bodyHash": "2eb791c465660a09",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《連結箱》是你儲存與移動物品的最佳夥伴——無論距離多遠，都能瞬間存取！🌍 擁有數千個 🎨 顏色編碼的通道、隨時隨地取得物品的能力，以及專屬玩家的個人儲存空間，這個模組讓物品管理變得如同魔法般便捷（只是這裡用的是染料而不是法術書）。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無論是建築師 🧱、收藏家 📦 還是紅石大師 🧠，這個模組都能讓你的裝備隨傳隨到，無論身在何處。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 無限通道，一箱統御所有</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用 3 種染料（從 Minecraft 的 16 色中挑選）設定 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">顏色編碼通道</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。你可獲得 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4,096</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 種獨特組合！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">點擊頂部的 3 個按鈕放入染料——或直接在工作台合成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">同一通道上的所有箱子 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共用同一個物品欄</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，無論相距多遠都能即時存取！🌍</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💎 打造專屬個人通道</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在箱扣上放置鑽石 💎 即可 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 箱子——現在這個通道將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獨屬於你</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂箱子將獲得 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雙倍物品欄容量</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！😱</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">其他玩家若取得鑰匙仍可潛行偷看，請妥善保管！🛡️</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧰 支援自動化與隨身攜帶</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可搭配漏斗使用，輕鬆實現自動化！⚙️</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">連結袋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 即可在任何地方存取你的箱子通道 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">隨時隨地</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！👜</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常適合基地連結、交易設施、紅石裝置，或是跨維度囤積戰利品！🧠</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版本需安裝由 Prospector 開發的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a> 才能使用此功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 資料夾內，檔名會根據設定類型命名為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有類型的設定檔都會存在，視具體模組而定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kyrptonaught\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kyrptonaught</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-storage\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Linked Storage</span></a> 模組為此專案奠定的基礎。《連結箱》最初僅是移植版本，目前已完全重寫為獨立模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chicken_bones\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chicken_Bones</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-storage\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ender Storage</span></a> 模組啟發了本專案。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝才華洋溢的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mim1q\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mim1q</span></a> 製作了所有精美的貼圖素材。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-walls\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/illager-invasion\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
